load ../infoflow-fact-provenance.maude

--- Cross-rule fact provenance (DR-0045 v1). Coverage: the reach never
--- under-reports (a hot source two hops upstream still denies; the label
--- token governs external/unattributable content; producer own-reads are in
--- the whole fact). Bite: a clean chain escapes an over-conservative label,
--- and untrusted laundering through an unlabeled fact is caught.

--- ============================ COVERAGE, leak reachable =====================

--- Coverage: two-hop chain. fB's producer read a hot source; fA's producer
--- assembled from fB (a direct fact edge). Consuming fA denies -- the hot
--- read travels the chain.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-FACT-PROVENANCE :
  prod(fB, (hot . nilT)) prod(fA, (edge(fB) . cold . nilT)) consume(fA)
  =>* C:Cfg leak .

--- Coverage: the label token. fA's content is partly unaccountable (seed /
--- input / unattributable root), and the sink is NOT cleared for fA's
--- declared label -- the token denies exactly as Phase 0 did.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-FACT-PROVENANCE :
  prod(fA, (lbl(fA) . cold . nilT)) lblOk(fA, false) consume(fA)
  =>* C:Cfg leak .

--- Coverage: producer own-reads join the WHOLE fact (the opaque box): even a
--- fact whose payload roots are all cold denies when its producer's own read
--- set was hot -- the implicit "this fact exists because the hot read
--- succeeded" flow stays inside the reach.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-FACT-PROVENANCE :
  prod(fA, (hot . cold . nilT)) consume(fA)
  =>* C:Cfg leak .

--- Coverage: the laundering closure. An UNLABELED fact (label token absent
--- from its reach because the sink clears the empty label trivially) still
--- denies when its computed chain carries a hot (untrusted) source -- the
--- integrity reading of the same rule.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-FACT-PROVENANCE :
  prod(fB, (hot . nilT)) prod(fA, (edge(fB) . nilT)) lblOk(fA, true) consume(fA)
  =>* C:Cfg leak .

--- ============================ BITE, no leak ================================

--- Bite: the relief. fA is over-labeled (the sink is NOT cleared for its
--- declared label) but its COMPUTED chain is clean and fully attributed --
--- no label token in the reach, so the declared label does not taint the
--- consumption.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-FACT-PROVENANCE :
  prod(fB, (cold . nilT)) prod(fA, (edge(fB) . cold . nilT)) lblOk(fA, false) consume(fA)
  =>* RESIDUAL:Cfg leak .

--- Bite: a clean single-hop fact under a cleared label consumes freely.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-FACT-PROVENANCE :
  prod(fA, (cold . lbl(fA) . nilT)) lblOk(fA, true) consume(fA)
  =>* RESIDUAL:Cfg leak .
